 "emoji": "🥔",
 "sentences": [
  "Mars has potato chip rocks!",
  "NASA's Curiosity rover found weird chip-shaped crystals at the Nazca drill hole.",
  "The rover drilled samples and zapped different crystal forms with lasers.",
  "Curiosity even used ultraviolet lamps for nighttime imaging of the crystals.",
  "Meanwhile, the rover also captured images of Phobos eclipsing the Sun.",
  "Finally, Curiosity drove away to continue its southerly trek of exploration."
